From 8cacb94f80b164d13b8627a6671ccbb8ac61d600 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joao Paulo Furtado <jfurtado141@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 19:15:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] perf(midway): adopt the engine transform-ownership fix
 and prepare transforms in beforeRender

Install the content-hashed core projdirty-12c96c25114f tarball (honours
matrixWorldAutoUpdate instead of forcing updateMatrixWorld(true)) and move the
once-per-world-draw world-matrix walk off the scene onBeforeRender hook onto
ctx.beforeRender, which fires on the projected and declined paths alike. The
old hook left every world matrix stale while the projection mirror rendered.

Verified: typecheck and vite build exit 0; check-frame-transforms red on the
old hook (max diff 0.66794) and green with the refactor (ratio 1.0, correct,
moving, no errors); all four browser playtests pass; two live-combat profiles
exit 0 with the player alive and the 99-batch projection census unchanged.
